# ---- Copyrighted paper material -------------------------------------------------
# Paper PDFs, supplementary documents, figure images and full-text extractions
# must never be committed (see adsim/test/papers/README.md). Keep them locally
# in each paper's assets/ folder (ignored as a whole). Only the transcribed
# numbers (reference_values.csv), our own READMEs/tests and the digitised curves
# in adsim/data/ belong in the repository.
# Extensionless files (e.g. a PDF saved without its suffix) under papers/:
# ignore every name without a dot, then re-include dotted names and directories.
adsim/test/papers/**/[!.]*
!adsim/test/papers/**/*.*
!adsim/test/papers/**/
adsim/test/papers/**/assets/
adsim/test/papers/**/*.pdf
adsim/test/papers/**/*.PDF
adsim/test/papers/**/*.docx
adsim/test/papers/**/*.doc
adsim/test/papers/**/*.xlsx
adsim/test/papers/**/*.xls
adsim/test/papers/**/*.pptx
adsim/test/papers/**/*.epub
adsim/test/papers/**/*.png
adsim/test/papers/**/*.jpg
adsim/test/papers/**/*_artifacts/
